IFEval instruction-following checkers
packages/crucible-bench/crucible_bench/ifeval.py

Ported checker by checker from the reference implementation in
google-research/google-research, at instruction_following_eval/ (instructions.py,
instructions_util.py, instructions_registry.py):

    Copyright 2026 The Google Research Authors.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

That port deviates from the reference deliberately in several places — an
unrecognized instruction id raises rather than scoring as followed, and a missing
langdetect is a hard error rather than a detection failure. Those deviations are
documented in the module docstring. Strict-mode accuracy only; the reference's
"loose" variant is not reported.

