GGUF container format and ggml block layouts
packages/crucible/crucible/gguf.py
packages/crucible/crucible/quant_types.py

These modules read the GGUF container format and compute exact bits-per-weight
from the ggml block layouts described in ggml/src/gguf.cpp and
ggml/src/ggml-common.h in llama.cpp:

    Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors
    Licensed under the MIT License.

No llama.cpp code is copied or redistributed here, and crucible takes no
llama.cpp dependency at runtime or build time. These are independent
implementations written against the documented format, and the distortion
figures in quant_types.py are our own measurements. The attribution is offered
as a courtesy to the authors of the format.

